{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55946","headline":"述象骨偈 · 惟劲","name":"述象骨偈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"象骨雄雄举世尊，统尽乾坤是一门。\n词锋未接承当好，莫待言教句里传。\n拟议终成山海隔，擗面浑机直下全。\n更欲会他泥牛吼，审细须听木马嘶（末字疑误）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"惟劲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55946.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55946","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}